{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16578","headline":"立春 · 冷朝阳","name":"立春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉律传佳节，青阳应此辰。\n土牛呈岁稔，彩燕表年春。\n腊尽星回次，寒余月建寅。\n风光行处好，云物望中新。\n流水初销冻，潜鱼欲振鳞。\n梅花将柳色，偏思越乡人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冷朝阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}